<title>USA: Sonus says drug to be reviewed in June.</title>
<headline>Sonus says drug to be reviewed in June.</headline>
<dateline>BOTHELL, Wash 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonus Pharmaceuticals Inc said it was notified by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration that a meeting of the Medical Imaging Drugs Advisory Committee to review the EchoGen Emulsion New Drug Application (NDA) was scheduled for June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>This is the first 1997 meeting of the committee which reviews all medical imaging drugs prior to approval. Sonus previously announced that the FDA had accepted the filing of the EchoGen NDA in October, 1996.</p>
</text>
